    <title>python代码源码、字节码分析方法</title>
    <link href="http://example.com/pyDis/"/>
    <id>http://example.com/pyDis/</id>
    <published>2025-07-13T04:34:31.000Z</published>
    <updated>2025-07-19T03:03:45.664Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="python-的-dis-模块"><a href="#python-的-dis-模块" class="headerlink" title="python 的 dis 模块"></a>python 的 dis 模块</h2><h3 id="简单介绍"><a href="#简单介绍" class="headerlink" title="简单介绍"></a>简单介绍</h3><p>这是一个python包，需要通过import使用，来看看官方的说明</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">dis 模块通过反汇编支持CPython的 bytecode 分析。该模块作为输入的 CPython 字节码在文件 Include/opcode.h 中定义，并由编译器和解释器使用。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="CPython"><a href="#CPython" class="headerlink" title="CPython"></a>CPython</h3><p>很好，引出了个新概念 CPython , 这是什么东西？</p><p>CPython即用C语言环境实现Python及其解释器， 根据Python实现方法的不同，有Cpython, Jython, Pypy等</p><p>比如Jython就是跑在JVM上的，我的理解上，就是通过不同的底层环境实现的不同Python解释器，就如同用机器汇编语言实现C语言一样，本质上就是编译器的实现环境、实现细节以及支持功能等等不同</p><p>就好像博主曾经用Python写过一个功能不全的C语言编译器，在这里可能就会被叫做PyC。</p><p>而CPython是当前应用最广泛即默认的Python解释器</p><h3 id="功能描述"><a href="#功能描述" class="headerlink" title="功能描述"></a>功能描述</h3><p>那 dis 这个模块有什么作用呢？</p><p>如果你只是想用Python写项目、跑AI、做开发，这个模块几乎用不到，但是这个模块可以将Python代码反汇编为字节码，更好的查看你的Python代码到底做了什么事情，从而在代码实现的角度进行时间、空间上的优化，或是发现原来代码中可能出现的BUG，这种BUG不是你的Python语法、设计思路有问题，而有可能是解释器本身不支持这样写。</p><h3 id="示例体验"><a href="#示例体验" class="headerlink" title="示例体验"></a>示例体验</h3><p>给定函数 myfunc（）<br><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">myfunc</span>(<span class="params">alist</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="built_in">len</span>(alist)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br><img src="/images/disFunc1.png" alt="IDE图片"><br>调用命令<br><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">dis.dis(myfunc)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br>输出<br><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"> <span class="number">57</span>           <span class="number">0</span> RESUME                   <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"> <span class="number">58</span>           <span class="number">2</span> LOAD_GLOBAL              <span class="number">1</span> (NULL + <span class="built_in">len</span>)</span><br><span class="line">             <span class="number">14</span> LOAD_FAST                <span class="number">0</span> (alist)</span><br><span class="line">             <span class="number">16</span> PRECALL                  <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">             <span class="number">20</span> CALL                     <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">             <span class="number">30</span> RETURN_VALUE</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">#其中 57、58是IDE中的行号</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br>另举一例做各部分解释：<br><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">f</span>(<span class="params">num</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> num == <span class="number">42</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="literal">True</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="literal">False</span></span><br><span class="line">​</span><br><span class="line">​</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> dis  <span class="comment"># 导入dis库</span></span><br><span class="line">dis.dis(f) </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">(<span class="number">1</span>)|(<span class="number">2</span>)|(<span class="number">3</span>)|(<span class="number">4</span>)|          (<span class="number">5</span>)         |(<span class="number">6</span>)|  (<span class="number">7</span>)</span><br><span class="line">---|---|---|---|----------------------|---|-------</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="number">2</span>|   |   |  <span class="number">0</span>|LOAD_FAST             |  <span class="number">0</span>|(num)</span><br><span class="line">   |--&gt;|   |  <span class="number">2</span>|LOAD_CONST            |  <span class="number">1</span>|(<span class="number">42</span>)</span><br><span class="line">   |   |   |  <span class="number">4</span>|COMPARE_OP            |  <span class="number">2</span>|(==)</span><br><span class="line">   |   |   |  <span class="number">6</span>|POP_JUMP_IF_FALSE     | <span class="number">12</span>|</span><br><span class="line">   |   |   |   |                      |   |</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="number">3</span>|   |   |  <span class="number">8</span>|LOAD_CONST            |  <span class="number">2</span>|(<span class="literal">True</span>)</span><br><span class="line">   |   |   | <span class="number">10</span>|RETURN_VALUE          |   |</span><br><span class="line">   |   |   |   |                      |   |</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="number">4</span>|   |&gt;&gt; | <span class="number">12</span>|LOAD_CONST            |  <span class="number">3</span>|(<span class="literal">False</span>)</span><br><span class="line">   |   |   | <span class="number">14</span>|RETURN_VALUE          |   |</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">第1列: 源代码中的相应行号. </span><br><span class="line">第2列: 可选地指示执行的当前指令(例如，当字节码来自框架对象时). </span><br><span class="line">第3列: 一个标签，表示从早期指令到此指令的可能JUMP. </span><br><span class="line">第4列: 字节码中与字节索引相对应的地址(这些是2的倍数，因为Python 3.6对每条指令使用2字节，而之前的版本可能会有所不同). </span><br><span class="line">第5列: 指令名称(也称为opname)，每个指令名称都在dis模块中简要解释，它们的实现可以在ceval.c(CPython的核心文件)中找到. </span><br><span class="line">第6列: Python内部用于获取一些常量或变量、管理堆栈、跳转到特定指令等的指令的参数(如果有的话). </span><br><span class="line">第7列: 对解释器的参数的人性化的解释. </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br>其余详细参数以及使用方法可以参照官方文档<br><a href="https://docs.python.org/zh-cn/3.13/library/dis.html">dis官方文档链接</a></p>]]></content>
    
    
